[6.775,"o","── PLAN · nothing below has run ───────────────────────────────────────\r\nThis is what ov does in your Google Cloud project *** (region europe-west2, zone europe-west2-b); --debug shows every command:\r\n\r\n  1. Template: render the elastic template into .openvidu/gcp/tf-gpc-openvidu-pro-elastic.tf\r\n     and its variables into .openvidu/gcp/openvidu.auto.tfvars.json (0600)\r\n  2. Machines: create the master and the media nodes: the master installs OpenVidu and the media nodes join it with Terraform (about 3 minutes, then OpenVidu installs)\r\n  3. Wait for OpenVidu to be up, read what it published (URL, credentials) and register this directory as the stack\r\n── end of plan ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n\r\n▶ Create the machines on Google Cloud…\r\n   · initialize Terraform in .openvidu/gcp (downloads the provider)\r\n"]
